  not offer. They are not passes, and the runner marks the PGlite cell
  incomplete for that reason. The same run also passed 5 of 5 on native
  SQLite and on three local stand-ins for hosted drivers (Cloudflare D1 under
  Miniflare, and the HTTP drivers for libSQL and for the hosted database
  service of the Bunny (bunny.net) edge platform, each against a local mock
  server); those local stand-ins are not
  hosted-provider evidence.

