## What these results do not cover

They do not grade every later combined source or exported package, establish
arbitrary PostgreSQL/MySQL migrations, or prove native Bun, hosted-provider
or deployed-site acceptance. The current MySQL reference was freshly captured
with Ruby 3.2.3; the later TypeScript grade reads those recorded answers.
Unavailable inputs, export exclusions and remaining failures are listed in
[UNTESTED-INPUTS.md](UNTESTED-INPUTS.md).
